@startuml
title UML state machine diagram

state ServiceCenterHome
ServiceCenterHome : entry / Logged in Service Center
ServiceCenterHome : do / Display home page
ServiceCenterHome : exit / EnterDamagedPartsList
ServiceCenterHome : exit / ExpiryNotificationPage
ServiceCenterHome : exit / UpdateInformationList

state ExpiryNotification
ExpiryNotification : entry / ToViewExpiryNotification
ExpiryNotification : do / SendServiceRequestToCarOwner
ExpiryNotification : exit / ReturnToServiceCenterHome

state EnteringDamagedPartsList
EnteringDamagedPartsList : entry / ToEnterDamagedPartsList
EnteringDamagedPartsList : do / PreparingAndEnteringDamagedPartsList
EnteringDamagedPartsList : exit / ReturnToServiceCenterHome

state UpdatingPartsInformation
UpdatingPartsInformation : entry / ToUpdateChangedPartsInformation
UpdatingPartsInformation : do / UpdateInformation
UpdatingPartsInformation : exit / ReturnToServiceCenterHome

state Logout
Logout : entry / ToLogout
Logout : do / Logout
Logout : exit / LoggedOutSuccessfully
@enduml
